WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:09.550
Right?

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:10.630
Wrong.

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:12.230
(Gunshot)

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:31.030
Let's put a smile on that face.

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:36.700
(Explosions)

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:42.590
He did it very, very precisely.

00:00:42.590 --> 00:00:44.150
I don't know how he resisted looking back

00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:49.230
You know we were calling explosions and light weight material that the special effects guy was blowing behind him

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:52.210
I think he wound up with bits of cork in his hair at the end of it.

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:06.230
There are three stages, one is like... uh, feel the hit

00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:08.920
Then it's like "ow mother fucker" then it's like get her

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:10.410
Action!

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:16.370
You push me harder! 

00:01:24.130 --> 00:01:28.010
One Jennifer's stunt double being a male that they filmed from Miami...

00:01:28.010 --> 00:01:30.100
So I'm looking at him what are we going to do? 

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:35.770
Butt pads... this that... we gotta' do a whole bunch of things with him... to have the same sort of body she would have. 

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:51.880
We had gotten it on the first take, we did two more takes, and I said please can we stop now? because it's starting to hurt. 

00:01:51.880 --> 00:02:02.320
Of course on the fourth take I broke my ribs and bruised my spleen, and so... and then began the saga of the constant journey to the emergency room. 

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:05.900
You've been selling big guns to bad people...

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:18.730
So I happened to get the stunt that suited me...

00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:24.100
But yeah I was a little unsure about something the first time we went down and my coat flew up, and I thought "I have no pants on"

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:25.890
Hans!

00:02:25.890 --> 00:02:27.380
Booby!

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:47.070
I looked at the faces of some slightly incredulous producers when I said I would do it myself...

